itltsvB8fX0Q7kNvwEc28zk&_nc_oc=Adqz59wQDe1DwF80iftpnIX3vO4_BqMfe3Eswsoti5KGxGlxU8asAnQUB18YJCU-MCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9KOagkYTtvB6rwD_vZ1XfFgj9dZKCuzcOAn1AvcG1keg&oe=6A3FDAB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ytOp98-IpYIQ7kNvwGhJN0-&_nc_oc=Adp02ItEaw_DX0LuXWqjrWNP0OMDXEiq26_rHOYHev1KrAJOXFIvtfuZpQ7i7w0HWAc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9bXsL-5FxThbZyIZ4yffd3G1D0FoCu82wZYQ4Ffgis9A&oe=6A3FDC4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C97NamZicM4Q7kNvwFoaFSc&_nc_oc=AdqBjBmgGPn5NmHB4vHVXvCSTawtPdp-F2o-K5NUQXu-_c0RYBrCJG9kEwotfOaizvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Yfspun-UpBbuJO26GkF2yM0kLdgobV_QXYR_HiA7c9A&oe=6A3FC96F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CnxvhzJwc4YQ7kNvwHPGaJ-&_nc_oc=Ado1lzy6o-8Ha6NNQ5DrwGS4Mzu99jquOhCRyuxof9SYRcijq320gkJ5_YaNavTxHTk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_tzelLGKbgYAZFyrxXKFvoictO4bC-8Q6HUIlyYN6wYg&oe=6A3FEB03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6c02ZtLiTdcQ7kNvwH6tCve&_nc_oc=Adr3QLWUmCHkEinBkXZmovNanhNY4ZpZ0UgWnFOfgsAZG5up5h058-l5CFgN3Gq98LQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-xphI-9piCRuYVSGPZHIf02_NuQJdzSkqOhxYacAYNBg&oe=6A3FE358"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rrKAe2-Jq8oQ7kNvwE-T8Mq&_nc_oc=Adr3LaXPdvrFbdxN374d5Rgy6gSgHNy_XvmDO-SjlBwRdVTAUhvkBKzx2cOC5_WQnPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ZEcqFY-ATQCFhNAI52ZFmxpjNuBlA6Ob_Po9xaa5frw&oe=6A3FBE3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080